# Roadmap

The project is mid-evolution. Several patterns from the broader KMMTemplate playbook do **not** apply yet because the corresponding migration has not happened. When suggesting changes, respect this ordering — partial migration creates worse churn than living with the current state.

## Migration Order

- [x] **Version bumps** — Kotlin 2.3.10, AGP 9.0.0, Compose MP 1.10.1, Ktor 3.3.3, Apollo 4.3.1, Coil 3.2.0 stable, Supabase 3.1.0, coroutines 1.10.2, serialization 1.10.0.
- [x] **DI migration to Koin** — per-module Koin module functions; `:shared:main/core/di/AppModule.kt` aggregates includes.
- [x] **State management migration to MVIKotlin.** Completed 2026-05-18.
  - Store / Intent / State / Label per feature, `BaseExecutor`, `Reducer`, `StoreFactory`.
  - `BaseViewModel<State, Label>` (`:shared:core-presentation`) binds `store.states` and `store.labels` through mappers.
  - Logging routed through Napier via `LoggingStoreFactory` in `:shared:core-mvikotlin/di/CoreMVIKotlinModule.kt`.
- [x] **Multi-module split.** Completed 2026-05-18. 16 modules under `android/` and `shared/`: `:android:app`, `:shared:main` (KMP shell), `:shared:common`, `:shared:common-ui`, `:shared:common-resources`, `:shared:core-domain`, `:shared:core-mvikotlin`, `:shared:core-navigation`, `:shared:core-network`, `:shared:core-presentation`, `:shared:core-resources`, `:shared:core-storage`, `:shared:feature-guides:{api,impl,presentation,ui}`. Convention plugins `kmp-library`, `kmp-feature-setup`, `compose-multiplatform-setup`, `android-application-setup`, `json-serialization` live in `build-logic`.
- [x] **moko-resources migration.** Completed 2026-05-19. `:shared:common-resources` switched from Compose Resources to moko-resources 0.26.1. `MR.strings.*`, `MR.files.*`, `MR.fonts.*` replace the `Res.*` accessors. Assets live under `:shared:common-resources/src/commonMain/moko-resources/{base, files, fonts}/`. Android `FileResource.readText(Context)` is bridged through an expect/actual `FileContentReader` injected via Koin.
- [x] **AGP 9 + KMP DSL cleanup.** Completed 2026-05-19. `KmpLibraryPlugin` now applies `com.android.kotlin.multiplatform.library` and configures the `androidLibrary { }` DSL. `gradle.properties` no longer carries `android.builtInKotlin=false`, `android.newDsl=false` or the temporary `android.sourceset.disallowProvider=false` bypass. `AndroidApplicationSetupPlugin` no longer applies `kotlin.android` (AGP 9 built-in Kotlin handles it). `ProjectExtensions` uses `com.android.build.api.dsl.ApplicationExtension`.
- [x] **KMMTemplate alignment.** Completed 2026-05-19.
  - `kmp-feature-setup` convention plugin auto-wires feature submodules by name (`api`/`impl`/`presentation`/`ui`); feature scripts apply only the alias and add feature-specific deps.
  - `:shared:core-mvikotlin` extracted from `:core-presentation` — owns `BaseExecutor`, `coreMVIKotlinModule`, and the `mvikotlin-core/main/logging/coroutines` re-exports.
  - Modules physically moved under `android/` and `shared/` directories to match KMMTemplate layout; settings include paths and `projects.*` accessors updated accordingly.
  - Baseline KMP dependencies centralised in `KmpLibraryPlugin` (kotlin stdlib, coroutines-core, serialization-json, Napier, moko-resources) — modules no longer redeclare these.
  - JVM/Desktop target removed (Android + iOS only): no `jvm()` in `KmpLibraryPlugin`, no `jvmMain` source sets, no `compose.desktop {}` block, `kotlinx-coroutines-swing` dropped from the catalog.
  - Module scripts switched to flat `commonMainDependencies {}` / `androidMainDependencies {}` / `iosMainDependencies {}` extension-call syntax (vs. nested `kotlin { sourceSets { … } }`).
- [x] **Supabase removal → Steam CDN.** Completed 2026-05-20. Phase 0 in `docs/strategy.md`.
  - Hero/item/ability icons built as Steam CDN URLs by `IconUrls` (`:shared:core-resources`); the Supabase listing layer (`ImageResourcesApi`/`ImageResourcesDataSource`) is gone, collapsed into `ResourcesRepositoryImpl`.
  - Position and Radiant/Dire icons bundled as moko-resources images (`:shared:common-resources/.../moko-resources/images/`).
  - `:shared:core-storage` reduced to a thin shell — no Supabase SDK, no buildConfig; reserved for future on-device persistent storage.
  - `kotlin.native.cacheKind=none` removed from `gradle.properties` — the iOS K/N compiler cache is restored (Supabase storage-kt was the blocker).
- [x] **Apollo→Ktor REST cutover + KMMTemplate navigation migration.** Completed 2026-05-22.
  - Apollo/GraphQL stack removed from `:shared:core-network`; replaced by `KtorClient`/`KtorClientImpl`/`NetworkEnvironment` + `coreNetworkKtorModule`.
  - `:shared:core-resources` migrated to commonMain-only: `ConstantsApiClient(Impl)` hitting REST `GET /v1/constants`; bundled `constant_*.json` files deleted; `FileContentReader`/`IconUrls`/`ConstantResourcesDataSource` removed.
  - `:shared:feature-guides:impl` migrated: `GuidesApiClient(Impl)` hitting REST `GET /v1/guides`; `Remote*Response` DTOs replace Apollo-generated types.
  - Navigation migrated to `Screen` marker interface + `@Serializable` route objects (`GuidesRoute`) + per-feature `ScreenApi` (`NavGraphBuilder.composableGuidesScreen()`). `AppScreens`/`LocalNavHost` removed.
  - Backend API key: `D2BH_API_KEY` in `local.properties`; `D2BH_ENVIRONMENT` optional.

Remaining work, in order:

